      "seed": 1761814134,
      "version": 58,
      "versionNonce": 1756436150,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787580828948,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ticket Master",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ticket Master",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YcrzwwYnSbN5-wVjxLVrK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 195.0824652777775,
      "y": -245.37354037136174,
      "width": 570,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1845684150,
      "version": 438,
      "versionNonce": 127489962,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787580828948,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n\nFunctional Requirement\n\n- browse the event seats\n- hold the seat and purchase it\n- Release the expire holds back to available\n\nNon-Functional Requirement\n\n- Strong consistency for ticket booking (no 2 users\nget the same seat/ticket)\n- High availability for seat browsing\n- low latency for ticket booking\n- handle high traffic for popular events\n\nBack of Envolop Estimations\n\n- Seats for sale: 50k\n- Buyers in the first min: 1M\n- browser reads per hold = 200:1\n\n--> 50k / 1M = 20 contenders per seat",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n\nFunctional Requirement\n\n- browse the event seats\n- hold the seat and purchase it\n- Release the expire holds back to available\n\nNon-Functional Requirement\n\n- Strong consistency for ticket booking (no 2 users get the same seat/ticket)\n- High availability for seat browsing\n- low latency for ticket booking\n- handle high traffic for popular events\n\nBack of Envolop Estimations\n\n- Seats for sale: 50k\n- Buyers in the first min: 1M\n- browser reads per hold = 200:1\n\n--> 50k / 1M = 20 contenders per seat",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eNdssrJ67ZBlGvGQI6RAg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 845.0512152777775,
      "y": -282.65479037136174,
      "width": 451,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1475903734,
      "version": 523,
      "versionNonce": 1527304182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787580828948,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Entities\n- seats\n- holds\n- orders\n\nAPI's\n\n- Get seats\nendpoint: GET: /v1/events/:eventId/seats\nresponse: seat[]\n\n- Hold Seat\nendpoint: POST: /v1/events/:eventId/holds\nRequest: { seatIds: seatId[] }\nResponse: { holdId, expiry }\n\n- Purchase Seat\nendpoint: POST: v1/holds/:holdId/purchase\nRequest: { paymentToken }\nResponse: { ticketId }",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Entities\n- seats\n- holds\n- orders\n\nAPI's\n\n- Get seats\nendpoint: GET: /v1/events/:eventId/seats\nresponse: seat[]\n\n- Hold Seat\nendpoint: POST: /v1/events/:eventId/holds\nRequest: { seatIds: seatId[] }\nResponse: { holdId, expiry }\n\n- Purchase Seat\nendpoint: POST: v1/holds/:holdId/purchase\nRequest: { paymentToken }\nResponse: { ticketId }",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
